{"4816620": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Max Diceman", "steam_appid": 4816620, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4820230], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Max Diceman is a 2D top-down roguelike RPG adventure game with a new mechanic - rolling 3D dice in battles and using those dice to change your powers at any time! </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4816620/extras/614b74e844e36d05b0cdd672c8b819fd.poster.avif?t=1786794596\" width=1170 height=608 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4816620/extras/614b74e844e36d05b0cdd672c8b819fd.webm?t=1786794596\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4816620/extras/614b74e844e36d05b0cdd672c8b819fd.mp4?t=1786794596\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore each randomly generated level to gather powerful dice, gear, and items on they way to uncover Max's story and defeat the horde's of enemies that stand in his way!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect over 100 D4, D6, D8, D10, D12, or D20 dice with unique powers and effects</strong><br><strong> </strong> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4816620/extras/bc243935d7fcc368fd36ff670dc8a2a9.poster.avif?t=1786794596\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4816620/extras/bc243935d7fcc368fd36ff670dc8a2a9.webm?t=1786794596\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4816620/extras/bc243935d7fcc368fd36ff670dc8a2a9.mp4?t=1786794596\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Move dice to different slots to give you an edge in battle or activate magic abilities</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More than 100 rare tide-turning pieces of gear - weapons to arm and equipment for your head, body and feet</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4816620/extras/54f8491c6658174c2e75ec94145e6843.poster.avif?t=1786794596\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4816620/extras/54f8491c6658174c2e75ec94145e6843.webm?t=1786794596\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4816620/extras/54f8491c6658174c2e75ec94145e6843.mp4?t=1786794596\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gather powerful items to restore health and magic or give you an advantage in battle</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle over 100 enemies and bosses that can have rare dice with special powers to obtain</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4816620/extras/1e002cb72a0d3921951879a4dd34278c.poster.avif?t=1786794596\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4816620/extras/1e002cb72a0d3921951879a4dd34278c.webm?t=1786794596\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4816620/extras/1e002cb72a0d3921951879a4dd34278c.mp4?t=1786794596\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong><